law.text:
		The Council shall have the following powers and duties to:

Determine the studies and research to be conducted by the Council;


Collect and disseminate information regarding the status of women in the Commonwealth and the nation;


Advise the Governor, the General Assembly, and the Governor's Secretaries on matters pertaining to women in the Commonwealth and the nation;


Establish and award scholarships pursuant to regulations and conditions prescribed by the Council; and


Develop programs and projects on matters pertaining to women in the Commonwealth and the nation through public-private partnerships.
